usage: ai_probe.py [-h] [--env-file ENV_FILE] pdf

Explicit developer PDF/Gemini probe; importing this module performs no work.

positional arguments:
  pdf                  PDF to analyze; may contain sensitive text

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --env-file ENV_FILE  Explicit optional development environment file
usage: extraction_probe.py [-h] [--text-file TEXT_FILE]
                           [--taxonomy-file TAXONOMY_FILE] [--model MODEL]

Explicit developer extraction diagnostic; no model/dependency work at import.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --text-file TEXT_FILE
                        UTF-8 tender text; defaults to synthetic procurement
                        fixture
  --taxonomy-file TAXONOMY_FILE
                        JSON taxonomy list; defaults to an empty taxonomy
  --model MODEL         Explicit model override; defaults to current
                        extraction chain's first model
